IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. POLBAT01.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IN-POLICIES ASSIGN TO POLIN
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT OUT-RATINGS ASSIGN TO POLOUT
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  IN-POLICIES.
COPY POLREC.
FD  OUT-RATINGS.
01  RATED-RECORD              PIC X(200).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-END-OF-FILE             PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-POLICY-COUNT            PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    OPEN INPUT IN-POLICIES
         OUTPUT OUT-RATINGS.

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-END-OF-FILE = 'Y'
        READ IN-POLICIES
            AT END
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-END-OF-FILE
            NOT AT END
                ADD 1 TO WS-POLICY-COUNT
                MOVE POLICY-RECORD TO RATED-RECORD
                WRITE RATED-RECORD
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM.

    CLOSE IN-POLICIES
          OUT-RATINGS.
    STOP RUN.
